+  17 Aug 2026 - BATCH 50. The first batch to edit the DATA snippets rather than the overrides.
+  NO override rows were added to this file. The two rows this batch was briefed to write both
+  turned out to be unnecessary, and one of them would have broken gate C3. Detail below.
+
+  WHAT BATCH 50 CHANGED
+  1. 21 city corrections in the data snippets, each verified against the school's own site.
+     Every one matched exactly one record on name AND stored city, and not one changed region,
+     so every count in tjjm-region-index is unchanged and the corpus is still 5,911 records.
+     Files touched: tjjm-gyms-data (14 edits), -17 (2), -19 (2), -14, -20, -24.
+  2. Fixed an INERT override row in tjjm-gym-websites-6. The row for Murdoc's Brazilian
+     Jiu-Jitsu (MWBJJ) & Self Defense Academy (GD JJ Affiliate) carried a STRAIGHT apostrophe
+     but the record uses a CURLY one (U+2019), so the row had never matched and murdocsbjj.com
+     - now an expired GoDaddy parking lander - was still linked. Rewritten with the curly
+     apostrophe; it now matches the record byte for byte and the blank finally takes effect.
+
+  WHAT BATCH 50 DID NOT DO, AND WHY. DO NOT RETRY EITHER WITHOUT READING THIS.
+  3. NOT DONE - renaming the WI/Burlington record "Evolution Jiu Jitsu" to
+     "Evolution Jiu Jitsu Burlington". That name ALREADY EXISTS as a separate record in
+     tjjm-gyms-data-45: same city, same address, same Facebook page. It is neither suppressed
